    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B03a2 scope (interactions & admin)","items":["Part of B03-consultation-core split. Controllers: consultation-attachment, consultation-feedback, admin-consultation, admin-feedback-rollup, consultation-telemetry.","Attachments: POST create/complete/content, GET list/get. Feedback: GET reason-codes, POST/GET :id/feedback; admin GET /admin/feedback/rollups.","Admin consultation: list/aggregate/getById under /admin/consultations (uses ApiEndpoint/custom patterns; handlers verified). Telemetry: GET /admin/consultations/:id/telemetry."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Attachment create/complete/content: upload lifecycle requests -> attachment records/content upload results. Verify multipart/content-type handling.","Feedback submit: POST /consultations/:id/feedback with reason/rating payload -> feedback record; rollups return aggregated admin metrics.","Admin aggregate: GET /admin/consultations/aggregate?from&to[&granularity] -> zero-filled new/revisit aggregation (scope depends on tenant/SUPER_ADMIN context).","Telemetry: GET /admin/consultations/:id/telemetry -> consultation telemetry payload. Verify exact schemas and access controls."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controller/service sources verified in local tree.","AdminConsultationController uses @ApiEndpoint/custom decorator patterns for some routes; handler methods are verified but route decorators are partially implicit — reconcile with OpenAPI/inventory for strict route list.","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes; attachment content storage backend is config-driven; admin cross-tenant scope behavior is implementation-specific (as noted in controller docs)."]}
